### Retrieve generation

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations/{{generationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Retrieve generations

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations
Accept: application/json

### Validate rejection of an invalid request body

POST {{baseUrl}}/ideations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "materials": []
}

### Validate rejection of an invalid generation ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations/not-a-uuid
Accept: application/json

### Validate not-found behavior

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Rate Generation request (expected: 400)
# The invalid body prevents a Gemini call, but the limiter still counts it.
# Call it till the limit is exceeded.

POST {{baseUrl}}/ideations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "materials": []
}

### Rate limit { step - 1 } List generations (expected: 200)

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations
Accept: application/json

### Rate limit { step - 2 } Retrieve a generation (expected: 200)
# Uses the same retrieval counter as the list endpoint.

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations/{{generationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Rate limit { step - 3 } List generations again (expected: 429)
# Exceeds the shared retrieval limit of two requests per minute.

GET {{baseUrl}}/ideations
Accept: application/json